      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "Thank you, Sensei!! (((o(≧∇≦)o)))"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm sorry!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150310,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Sensei! I'm really so, so sorry!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150320,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "No need to apologize. It's okay."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150330,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I didn't even get hurt! It's completely fine."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150340,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150350,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'd hoped to put on a snazzy performance for you..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150370,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "How it devolved into such an embarrassing situation so quickly... I really don't know!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150380,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "What are you saying? It was the cherry on top!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150390,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "I thought it was the snazziest!"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150400,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Is that so?"
