    {
      "Id": 160150430,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I suppose..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150440,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "We'll leave it at that then!! ((o(≧∇≦)o)))"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It looks like"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150460,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "our time is coming to an end."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150470,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's a little... How should I say it...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150480,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "╯︿╰"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150490,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "...Airi?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150500,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Seems like there's something on your mind."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "What I'm trying to say here..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "It's hard to put into words."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150540,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Maybe it's because..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Hm"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150560,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm rambling needlessly at this point."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150570,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "I'm sorry. ╯︿╰"
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150600,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Hey, Sensei. I was wondering."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150610,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Apologies, this is a completely different topic, but..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150620,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "About today..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150630,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'm a bit embarrassed, so I'd appreciate it if you, well..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 160150640,
